              <a class="sw-btn" href="/autocad">Request a Quote</a>
            </div>
            <div class="sw-card">
              <div class="sw-card-img"><img src="https://aptusinfotech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Revit.png" alt="Revit" loading="lazy"/></div>
              <h3>Revit</h3>
              <p>Building Information Modeling (BIM) software for architects, engineers, and construction professionals.</p>

              <a class="sw-btn" href="/revit">Request a Quote</a>
            </div>
            <div class="sw-card">
              <div class="sw-card-img"><img src="https://aptusinfotech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/3d-max.png" alt="3ds Max" loading="lazy"/></div>
              <h3>3ds Max</h3>
              <p>3D modeling, animation, and rendering software for games, film, and motion graphics.</p>

              <a class="sw-btn" href="/3ds-max">Request a Quote</a>
            </div>
            <div class="sw-card">
              <div class="sw-card-img"><img src="https://aptusinfotech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/autodesk-docs.png" alt="Autodesk Docs" loading="lazy"/></div>
              <h3>Autodesk Docs</h3>
              <p>Cloud-based document management solution for architecture, engineering, and construction projects.</p>

              <a class="sw-btn" href="/autodesk-docs">Request a Quote</a>
            </div>
            <div class="sw-card">
              <div class="sw-card-img"><img src="https://aptusinfotech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Navisworks.png" alt="Navisworks" loading="lazy"/></div>
              <h3>Navisworks</h3>
              <p>3D design review and coordination software for construction projects.</p>

              <a class="sw-btn" href="/navisworks">Request a Quote</a>
            </div>
            <div class="sw-card">
              <div class="sw-card-img"><img src="https://aptusinfotech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Infraworks.png" alt="InfraWorks" loading="lazy"/></div>
              <h3>InfraWorks</h3>
              <p>Civil infrastructure design software for creating, visualizing, and analyzing infrastructure models.</p>

            </div>
            <div class="sw-card">
              <div class="sw-card-img"><img src="https://aptusinfotech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Civil-3d-1.png" alt="Civil 3D" loading="lazy"/></div>
              <h3>Civil 3D</h3>
              <p>Civil engineering design and documentation software for BIM workflows.</p>

              <a class="sw-btn" href="/civil-3d">Request a Quote</a>
            </div>
            <div class="sw-card">
              <div class="sw-card-img"><img src="https://aptusinfotech.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Bim.png" alt="BIM Collaborate Pro" loading="lazy"/></div>
              <h3>BIM Collaborate Pro</h3>
              <p>Cloud-based design collaboration and coordination software for BIM projects and teams.</p>

            </div>
            <div class="sw-card">
              <h3>Gold Partner Status</h3>
              <p>Our Gold Partner status represents the highest level of expertise and commitment to Autodesk solutions.</p>

            </div>
            <div class="sw-card">
              <h3>Genuine Products</h3>

            </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="sw-midcta">
            <div class="container">
                <h2>Ready to Get Started?</h2>
                <a class="sw-btn sw-btn--light" href="#Form">Get Your Quote Now</a>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="sw-contact" id="Form">
            <div class="container">
                <h2>Have questions? We can help</h2>
                <form class="sw-form" action="/contactus" method="post">
                    <div class="sw-form-row">
                        <div class="sw-form-group"><label>First Name *</label><input type="text" name="first_name" required="required"/></div>
                        <div class="sw-form-group"><label>Last Name *</label><input type="text" name="last_name" required="required"/></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sw-form-row">
                        <div class="sw-form-group"><label>Email *</label><input type="email" name="email" placeholder="name@mail.com" required="required"/></div>
                        <div class="sw-form-group"><label>Phone *</label><input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="e.g, +968 0000 0000" required="required"/></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="sw-form-group"><label>Message</label><textarea name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Message"/></div>
                    <button type="submit" class="sw-btn">Submit Now</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </section>
</div></div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </t>
</t>
